# Retail. Patch 12.1.5 is interface 120105 (warcraft.wiki.gg, "Getting the current interface number",
# 2026-10-22); the 12.0 numbers stay for players a patch behind. After a retail patch, add the number
# /dump select(4, GetBuildInfo()) prints, or the client calls the addon out of date.
## Interface: 120105, 120100, 120007, 120005, 120001, 120000
## Title: Gold Forever
## Notes: Records your characters for the Gold Forever web app. Type /gf export and paste it at gold-forever.app.
## Version: 0.16.1
## SavedVariables: GoldForeverDB
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\GoldForever\Media\Icon.tga
## AddonCompartmentFunc: GoldForever_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: GoldForever_OnAddonCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: GoldForever_OnAddonCompartmentLeave
## OptionalDeps: GoldForever_Data

